{
    "title": "AirPlay : Miracast",
    "description": "AirPlay Miracast is an application that cast the screen and streams from your mobile device to a TV by integrating Apple AirPlay, Google Cast and DLNA protocols, which can be installed on your Android TV to receive web videos, music, movies , games and photos stream from most Android phones that support the Google Cast protocol. the ultimate solution for Android users looking for seamless screen mirroring on Apple AirPlay Miracast devices!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n\r\n- Support for multiple devices with Apple AirPlay Miracast and Screen Mirror\r\n- AirPlay Miracast to TV for the best video and movie watching experience.\r\n- AirPlay Miracast videos, images and files to your smart TV.\r\n- One-click AirPlay Cast \r\n- Quick and easy one-click Cast\r\n- Simple and fast screen mirroring\r\n- Phone screen mirroring to a big TV faster.\r\n- Stream to TV for the best video and movie watching experience.\r\n- Play smartphone games on your TV by screen mirroring with AirPlay Miracast\r\n- Play mobile games on your TV by screen mirroring with AirPlay Miracast\r\n- Live video streaming on web browser.\r\n- Quick access to your favorite apps and channels.\r\n- Fast, easy-to-use connectivity with AirPlay Miracast\r\n- High-speed streaming and screen mirroring\r\n- Live video streaming to web browser.\r\n- High-speed screen mirroring\r\n- Simple and fast screen mirroring\r\n- Screen Mirroring from phone to a big TV in 4K quality.\r\n\r\nSteps to use AirPlay Miracast\r\n\r\n-Download the AirPlay Miracast application on your devices (Android TV, TV, Screen,...).\r\n-Connect your Android mobile device and your devices (Android TV, TV, Screen,...) to the same Wi-Fi network.\r\n-Open the AirPlay Miracast application on your devices (Android TV, TV, Screen,...) and note its displayed name.\r\n-Enable Android phone's wireless screen projection/casting function or AirPlay Miracast.\r\n-Select the name of your Android Mobile from the list of available devices.\r\n-The screen of your Android device will now be mirrored on your Smart TV. Appreciate!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n\r\n- Support for multiple devices with Apple AirPlay and Miracast\r\n- AirPlay to TV for the best video and movie watching experience.\r\n- AirPlay videos, images and files to your smart TV.\r\n- One-click AirPlay Cast \r\n- Quick and easy one-click Cast\r\n- Simple and fast screen mirroring\r\n- Phone screen mirroring to a big TV faster.\r\n- Stream to TV for the best video and movie watching experience.\r\n- Play smartphone games on your TV by screen mirroring with Miracast and AirPlay\r\n- Play mobile games on your TV by screen mirroring with AirPlay\r\n- Live video streaming on web browser.\r\n- Quick access to your favorite apps and channels.\r\n- Fast, easy-to-use connectivity with AirPlay\r\n- High-speed streaming and screen mirroring\r\n- Live video streaming to web browser.\r\n- High-speed screen mirroring\r\n- Simple and fast screen mirroring\r\n- Screen Mirroring from phone to a big TV in 4K quality.\r\n\r\nSteps to use Apple Airplay video\r\n\r\n-Download the Apple Airplay Video application on your devices (Android TV, TV, Screen,...).\r\n-Connect your Android mobile device and your devices (Android TV, TV, Screen,...) to the same Wi-Fi network.\r\n-Open the Apple Airplay application on your devices (Android TV, TV, Screen,...) and note its displayed name.\r\n-Enable Android phone's wireless screen projection/casting function or AirPlay Video.\r\n-Select the name of your Android Mobile from the list of available devices.\r\n-The screen of your Android device will now be mirrored on your Smart TV. Appreciate!\r\n\r\nLooking for a free app that will allow you to use AirPlay to screen mirror to any TV device? Then you should try out Apple AirPlay TV Screen Mirroring",
    "descriptionHTML": "AirPlay Miracast is an application that cast the screen and streams from your mobile device to a TV by integrating Apple AirPlay, Google Cast and DLNA protocols, which can be installed on your Android TV to receive web videos, music, movies , games and photos stream from most Android phones that support the Google Cast protocol. the ultimate solution for Android users looking for seamless screen mirroring on Apple AirPlay Miracast devices!<br><br>FEATURES:<br><br>- Support for multiple devices with Apple AirPlay Miracast and Screen Mirror<br>- AirPlay Miracast to TV for the best video and movie watching experience.<br>- AirPlay Miracast videos, images and files to your smart TV.<br>- One-click AirPlay Cast <br>- Quick and easy one-click Cast<br>- Simple and fast screen mirroring<br>- Phone screen mirroring to a big TV faster.<br>- Stream to TV for the best video and movie watching experience.<br>- Play smartphone games on your TV by screen mirroring with AirPlay Miracast<br>- Play mobile games on your TV by screen mirroring with AirPlay Miracast<br>- Live video streaming on web browser.<br>- Quick access to your favorite apps and channels.<br>- Fast, easy-to-use connectivity with AirPlay Miracast<br>- High-speed streaming and screen mirroring<br>- Live video streaming to web browser.<br>- High-speed screen mirroring<br>- Simple and fast screen mirroring<br>- Screen Mirroring from phone to a big TV in 4K quality.<br><br>Steps to use AirPlay Miracast<br><br>-Download the AirPlay Miracast application on your devices (Android TV, TV, Screen,...).<br>-Connect your Android mobile device and your devices (Android TV, TV, Screen,...) to the same Wi-Fi network.<br>-Open the AirPlay Miracast application on your devices (Android TV, TV, Screen,...) and note its displayed name.<br>-Enable Android phone&#39;s wireless screen projection/casting function or AirPlay Miracast.<br>-Select the name of your Android Mobile from the list of available devices.<br>-The screen of your Android device will now be mirrored on your Smart TV. Appreciate!<br><br>FEATURES:<br><br>- Support for multiple devices with Apple AirPlay and Miracast<br>- AirPlay to TV for the best video and movie watching experience.<br>- AirPlay videos, images and files to your smart TV.<br>- One-click AirPlay Cast <br>- Quick and easy one-click Cast<br>- Simple and fast screen mirroring<br>- Phone screen mirroring to a big TV faster.<br>- Stream to TV for the best video and movie watching experience.<br>- Play smartphone games on your TV by screen mirroring with Miracast and AirPlay<br>- Play mobile games on your TV by screen mirroring with AirPlay<br>- Live video streaming on web browser.<br>- Quick access to your favorite apps and channels.<br>- Fast, easy-to-use connectivity with AirPlay<br>- High-speed streaming and screen mirroring<br>- Live video streaming to web browser.<br>- High-speed screen mirroring<br>- Simple and fast screen mirroring<br>- Screen Mirroring from phone to a big TV in 4K quality.<br><br>Steps to use Apple Airplay video<br><br>-Download the Apple Airplay Video application on your devices (Android TV, TV, Screen,...).<br>-Connect your Android mobile device and your devices (Android TV, TV, Screen,...) to the same Wi-Fi network.<br>-Open the Apple Airplay application on your devices (Android TV, TV, Screen,...) and note its displayed name.<br>-Enable Android phone&#39;s wireless screen projection/casting function or AirPlay Video.<br>-Select the name of your Android Mobile from the list of available devices.<br>-The screen of your Android device will now be mirrored on your Smart TV. Appreciate!<br><br>Looking for a free app that will allow you to use AirPlay to screen mirror to any TV device? Then you should try out Apple AirPlay TV Screen Mirroring",
